      "audit_sha256": "33725464fbb1320ca2e39bdb42039d9a9774cf06f3a78ae9a0f626d4242ce893",
      "claim_text": "On five Hilti 2022 recordings on which no camera-IMU estimate had been made, Calibrex's targetless camera-IMU rotation for the two forward Alphasense cameras (cam0, cam1) gives honest per-axis verdicts against Hilti's Kalibr calibration: every rotation axis it judges (reported std at most 0.3 deg and its 1 deg known-bad control detected on held-out windows) is within 1.0 deg, every clock offset it judges within 0.75 ms; it judges at least half of the axes; an axis judged on several recordings spans at most 1.0 deg; and an axis judged for both cameras reproduces Kalibr's cam0-to-cam1 rotation within 0.75 deg.",
      "pair_id": "camera-imu",
      "protocol_id": "hilti-camera-imu-v3",
